if ((CUR == '$') || (CUR == '(') ||
(IS_ASCII_DIGIT(CUR)) ||
(CUR == '\'') || (CUR == '"') ||
(CUR == '.' && IS_ASCII_DIGIT(NXT(1)))) {
lc = 0;
} else if (CUR == '*') {
lc = 1;
} else if (CUR == '/') {
lc = 1;
} else if (CUR == '@') {
lc = 1;
} else if (CUR == '.') {
lc = 1;
} else {
SKIP_BLANKS;
name = xmlXPathScanName(ctxt);
if ((name != NULL) && (xmlStrstr(name, (xmlChar *) "::") != NULL)) {
#ifdef DEBUG_STEP
xmlGenericError(xmlGenericErrorContext,
"PathExpr: Axis\n");
#endif
lc = 1;
xmlFree(name);
} else if (name != NULL) {
int len =xmlStrlen(name);
while (NXT(len) != 0) {
if (NXT(len) == '/') {
#ifdef DEBUG_STEP
xmlGenericError(xmlGenericErrorContext,
"PathExpr: AbbrRelLocation\n");
#endif
lc = 1;
break;
} else if (IS_BLANK_CH(NXT(len))) {
